  "email_html_body": "\n    <div style=\"font-family: -apple-system, 'PingFang TC', 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto; color: #1f2937;\">\n      <h1 style=\"color: #007bff; text-align:center; font-size: 24px;\">GitHub 開源科技報告</h1>\n      <p style=\"text-align:center; color:#666; margin-bottom: 30px;\">日期: 2026-08-10</p>\n    \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">3d-graphics</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">kage</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: HTML | Star: 595</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">透過 Three.js 實時渲染，呈現了京都山寺的五章互動式夜間漫步體驗。這是一個展示網頁 3D 圖形技術和互動式敘事潛力的範例，對於學習 WebGL 或 Three.js 的開發者來說，是極佳的參考專案。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/MengTo/kage\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/3d-graphics/kage\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">ai-agents</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">openclaw</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 385,708</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">旨在建立一個跨作業系統和平台的個人 AI 助理，讓用戶能更便捷地與 AI 互動。其目標是提供高度個人化的智慧助理體驗，值得關注其在通用 AI 助理領域的發展潛力。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/ai-agents/openclaw\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">superpowers</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Shell | Star: 269,744</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">是一個代理式技能框架和軟體開發方法論，旨在提升開發效率和專案品質。這個專案的目標是透過提供一套有效的工作流程和工具，幫助團隊更好地協作和交付軟體。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/obra/superpowers\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/ai-agents/superpowers\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">awesome-growth-hacking-skills</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Shell | Star: 796</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">彙集了適用於 Claude、ChatGPT 和 Manus 等 AI 代理的成長駭客技能，旨在幫助用戶利用 AI 提升行銷和業務增長。對於希望透過 AI 工具實現高效市場推廣和用戶獲取的專業人士來說，這是一個值得關注的資源。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/mikiarlo3/awesome-growth-hacking-skills\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/ai-agents/awesome-growth-hacking-skills\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">ai-media-editing</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">JoyAI-Video-Edit</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 612</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">提供了基於自迴歸擴散模型實現的即時開放式影片編輯功能。這個專案展示了 AI 在影片內容創作和編輯領域的最新應用，對於影片製作人或多媒體開發者來說，具有革新性的潛力。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/jd-opensource/JoyAI-Video-Edit\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/ai-media-editing/JoyAI-Video-Edit\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">ai-tools</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">human-writing</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 2,104</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">旨在讓 AI 生成的中文內容更具人性化和自然語氣，提供開箱即用的通用創作與改稿技能。對於需要 AI 協助撰寫或優化中文文案，使其更貼近真人表達風格的使用者來說，此工具極具價值。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/KKKKhazix/human-writing\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/ai-tools/human-writing\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">open-kimi-ppt-skill</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Unknown | Star: 1,609</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">是一個非官方的 Kimi Slides 技能，讓 AI 代理能夠生成可編輯的 PPTD 和 PPTX 簡報，並提供本地瀏覽器編輯器。對於需要快速生成專業簡報，並希望透過 AI 提升效率的用戶來說，這是一個非常實用的工具。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Binaryify/open-kimi-ppt-skill\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/ai-tools/open-kimi-ppt-skill\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">career-development</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">developer-roadmap</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 364,020</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">提供互動式的技術路線圖、指南及其他教育內容，旨在幫助開發者規劃職業生涯並提升技能。對於希望有系統地學習新技術或規劃未來發展方向的開發者來說，這是極具參考價值的工具。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/nilbuild/developer-roadmap\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/career-development/developer-roadmap\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">cybersecurity</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">claude-red</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: JavaScript | Star: 707</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">是一個為 Claude AI 技能系統設計的進攻性安全技能庫，包含多種攻擊面（如 SQL 注入、shellcode）的專業方法論。對於網路安全研究人員或紅隊成員來說，這是一個利用 AI 提升安全測試和漏洞挖掘效率的強大工具。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/0xwilliamortiz/claude-red\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/cybersecurity/claude-red\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">developer-tools</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">public-apis</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 455,228</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">提供了大量免費且公開的 API 列表，涵蓋多種應用領域，方便開發者快速找到適合的資源。對於需要整合外部服務或尋找靈感的專案來說，這是一個不可或缺的寶庫。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/public-apis/public-apis\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/developer-tools/public-apis\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">low-level-programming</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">asm-hall-of-shame</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: C | Star: 661</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">探討了在 CPU 效能方面表現極差的組合語言程式碼，從反面角度揭示了效能最佳化的重要性。對於深入研究底層系統、理解 CPU 工作原理以及避免效能陷阱的開發者來說，這是一個有趣的學習資源。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/xoreaxeaxeax/asm-hall-of-shame\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/low-level-programming/asm-hall-of-shame\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">mobile-automation</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">phone-harness</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#3b82f6; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Fast-Rising</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 880</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">旨在讓 AI 代理能夠控制手機，實現自動化操作和智慧互動。這個專案展示了 AI 在移動設備控制方面的潛力，對於開發智慧助理或實現手機自動化任務具有重要意義。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/ShawnPana/phone-harness\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/mobile-automation/phone-harness\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <h2 style=\"border-bottom: 2px solid #e5e7eb; padding-bottom: 8px; margin-top: 32px;\">programming-education</h2>\n        \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">build-your-own-x</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Markdown | Star: 538,137</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">旨在透過從頭開始重建熱門技術，幫助開發者深入理解程式設計原理。這對於希望透過實作來提升技能，並掌握底層知識的學習者來說是極具價值的資源。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/codecrafters-io/build-your-own-x\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/programming-education/build-your-own-x\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">freeCodeCamp</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: TypeScript | Star: 453,708</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">是一個開源的程式碼庫和課程平台，提供免費學習數學、程式設計和電腦科學的機會。對於全球各地希望免費獲取高品質技術教育的學習者來說，這是一個改變人生的重要專案。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/freeCodeCamp/freeCodeCamp\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/programming-education/freeCodeCamp\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 6px 0;\">\n          <strong style=\"color:#007bff; font-size:1.1em;\">free-programming-books</strong>\n          <span style=\"background:#22c55e; color:#fff; font-size:0.75em; padding:2px 8px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:8px;\">Top Star</span>\n        </p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 8px 0; color:#666; font-size:0.9em;\">語言: Python | Star: 394,041</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 10px 0; font-size:0.95em; line-height:1.6;\">彙集了大量可免費取得的程式設計書籍資源，涵蓋多種程式語言和技術主題。對於尋找免費學習材料的開發者和學生而言，這是一個非常實用的知識庫。</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0; font-size:0.9em;\">\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/EbookFoundation/free-programming-books\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">原始連結</a>\n          &nbsp;|&nbsp;\n          <a href=\"https://github.com/Kevinte67228/AI-Skill/tree/main/programming-education/free-programming-books\" style=\"color:#007bff; text-decoration:none;\">本地倉庫路徑</a>\n        </p>\n      </div>\n            \n      <div style=\"background:#f9fafb; border-radius:8px; padding:16px; margin-bottom:14px; border:1px solid #e5e7eb;\">\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0